id=samsung_gamebooster
name=Samsung Game Booster (GameTools + GOS + Game Launcher)
version=vDEV
versionCode=1
author=azrim
description=Restore the Samsung gaming stack (Game Booster/gametools, Game Optimization Service, Game Launcher) as system apps on debloated One UI ROMs. One build for all ROMs: customize.sh auto-picks the Game Booster APK matching the ROM's Android version. Permission allowlists are added additively so any ROM-provided allowlist is preserved. Requires a KernelSU metamodule. Reboot after install.
